# Native TorchTitan (Qwen3.8) pack. CUDA only: Qwen3.5/3.8 Gated DeltaNet kernels
# come from attn-gym, which imports CuTe/cuDNN kernels unconditionally.
#
# TorchTitan has no torch pin and tracks the PyTorch nightly. Pin the nightly
# from the same day as the TorchTitan commit (2026-10-05).
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/nightly/cu130

torch==2.15.0.dev20261005+cu130

